    "The camera opens with only the viewfinder and the shutter. Warnings about the photo always show.": {
      "comment": "Explains the clean view switch.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Kamera öffnet nur mit Sucher und Auslöser. Warnungen zum Foto werden immer angezeigt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La cámara se abre solo con el visor y el obturador. Las advertencias sobre la foto siempre se muestran."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "L’appareil photo s’ouvre avec seulement le viseur et le déclencheur. Les avertissements sur la photo restent toujours affichés."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La fotocamera si apre solo con il mirino e il pulsante di scatto. Gli avvisi sulla foto vengono sempre mostrati."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "カメラはビューファインダーとシャッターだけの状態で開きます。写真に関する警告は常に表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "카메라가 뷰파인더와 셔터만 있는 상태로 열립니다. 사진에 관한 경고는 항상 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De camera opent met alleen de zoeker en de sluiterknop. Waarschuwingen over de foto worden altijd getoond."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A câmera abre só com o visor e o obturador. Os avisos sobre a foto sempre aparecem."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "相机打开时只显示取景器和快门。关于照片的警告始终会显示。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "相機開啟時只顯示觀景窗和快門。關於照片的警告一律會顯示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The camera works only when nope. fills the screen.": {
      "comment": "Shown on iPad in Split View, Slide Over or Stage Manager. Keep \"nope.\" unchanged: it is the app's name.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Kamera funktioniert nur, wenn nope. den ganzen Bildschirm einnimmt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La cámara solo funciona cuando nope. ocupa toda la pantalla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "L’appareil photo ne fonctionne que lorsque nope. occupe tout l’écran."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La fotocamera funziona solo quando nope. occupa tutto lo schermo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "カメラは nope. が画面全体に表示されているときだけ使えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "카메라는 nope.가 전체 화면일 때만 작동합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De camera werkt alleen als nope. het hele scherm vult."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A câmera só funciona quando o nope. ocupa a tela inteira."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "只有在 nope. 占满整个屏幕时才能使用相机。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "相機只有在 nope. 佔滿整個螢幕時才能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The light is off: the system didn't allow it, for example because the device is too warm. Turn Light off and on again in Quick Controls to try again, or choose a lower brightness.": {
      "comment": "Explains the Light Unavailable warning. Light and Quick Controls are the names of camera controls.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das Licht ist aus: Das System hat es nicht zugelassen, zum Beispiel weil das Gerät zu warm ist. Schalte Licht in den Schnellsteuerungen aus und wieder ein, um es erneut zu versuchen, oder wähle eine geringere Helligkeit."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La luz está apagada: el sistema no la ha permitido, por ejemplo porque el dispositivo está demasiado caliente. Desactiva y vuelve a activar Luz en Controles rápidos para intentarlo de nuevo, o elige un brillo menor."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La lumière est éteinte : le système ne l'a pas autorisée, par exemple parce que l'appareil est trop chaud. Désactivez puis réactivez Lumière dans Commandes rapides pour réessayer, ou choisissez une luminosité plus faible."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La luce è spenta: il sistema non l'ha consentita, ad esempio perché il dispositivo è troppo caldo. Disattiva e riattiva Luce in Controlli rapidi per riprovare, oppure scegli una luminosità più bassa."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ライトはオフです。デバイスが熱くなりすぎているなどの理由で、システムが許可しませんでした。もう一度試すにはクイックコントロールでライトをオフにしてから再びオンにするか、明るさを下げてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "조명이 꺼져 있습니다. 기기가 너무 뜨거운 등의 이유로 시스템이 허용하지 않았습니다. 다시 시도하려면 빠른 컨트롤에서 조명을 껐다가 다시 켜거나, 더 낮은 밝기를 선택하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De lamp is uit: het systeem stond het niet toe, bijvoorbeeld omdat het apparaat te warm is. Zet Lamp uit en weer aan in Snelle bediening om het opnieuw te proberen, of kies een lagere helderheid."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A luz está desligada: o sistema não a permitiu, por exemplo porque o dispositivo está quente demais. Desative e ative Luz novamente em Controles rápidos para tentar de novo, ou escolha um brilho menor."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "灯光已关闭：系统不允许使用，例如设备过热。要重试，请在快捷控制中关闭再打开灯光，或选择较低的亮度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "燈光已關閉：系統不允許使用，例如裝置過熱。若要重試，請在快速控制中關閉再開啟燈光，或選擇較低的亮度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The photo wasn't taken. Try again.": {
      "comment": "Shown when taking a photo failed.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das Foto wurde nicht aufgenommen. Versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "No se tomó la foto. Inténtalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La photo n’a pas été prise. Réessayez."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La foto non è stata scattata. Riprova."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "写真を撮影できませんでした。もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "사진을 찍지 못했습니다. 다시 시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De foto is niet gemaakt. Probeer het opnieuw."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A foto não foi tirada. Tente novamente."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "未能拍摄照片。请重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "未能拍攝照片。請再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The subject may be too close to focus. Try %@.": {
      "comment": "Hint on the camera when autofocus can't get close enough. The value is a lens name such as Ultra Wide.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Das Motiv ist möglicherweise zu nah zum Scharfstellen. Versuche %@."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Es posible que el sujeto esté demasiado cerca para enfocar. Prueba %@."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le sujet est peut-être trop proche pour la mise au point. Essayez %@."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Il soggetto potrebbe essere troppo vicino per mettere a fuoco. Prova %@."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "被写体が近すぎてピントが合わない可能性があります。%@を試してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "피사체가 너무 가까워 초점을 맞추지 못할 수 있습니다. %@을(를) 사용해 보세요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Het onderwerp is mogelijk te dichtbij om scherp te stellen. Probeer %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "O assunto pode estar perto demais para focar. Experimente %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "主体可能太近，无法对焦。请尝试%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "主體可能太近，無法對焦。請嘗試%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The volume buttons, and the Camera Control on iPhones that have one, take a photo.": {
      "comment": "Accessibility screen: hardware buttons work as the shutter. Camera Control is Apple's name for the camera button on recent iPhones.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Lautstärketasten und die Kamerasteuerung (auf iPhones, die eine haben) nehmen ein Foto auf."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Los botones de volumen, y el Control de la Cámara en los iPhone que lo tienen, toman una foto."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les boutons de volume, et le bouton Commande de l’appareil photo sur les iPhone qui en ont un, prennent une photo."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "I tasti del volume, e il Controllo fotocamera sugli iPhone che lo hanno, scattano una foto."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "音量ボタンと、カメラコントロール（搭載されているiPhoneのみ）で写真を撮影できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "음량 버튼과 카메라 컨트롤(지원하는 iPhone)로 사진을 찍을 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De volumeknoppen, en de cameraknop op iPhones die er een hebben, maken een foto."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Os botões de volume, e o Controle da Câmera nos iPhones que o têm, tiram uma foto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "音量按钮以及相机控制（配备该按钮的 iPhone）可拍摄照片。"
